flowchart TB
    A1["Interface layer: CLI commands (configure, launch, monitor, export, history, steer)"]
    A2["Interface layer: HTML dashboard (generated at milestones, replay slider, charts)"]
    ORCH["Orchestrator (evolutionary loop, population, selection, checkpointing)"]
    LLM["LLM Provider (vendor abstraction)"]
    GEN["Code generation (agent)"]
    REF["Reflection / repair (agent)"]
    CAND["Candidate code (isolated in OS-level sandbox)"]
    VER["Verifier (trusted)"]
    GGEN["Graph Generator (nauty geng + directg)"]
    EVAL["Evaluator (trusted)"]
    DATA["Data layer: JSON state + candidates/ + reflections/ + results/ on disk"]

    A1 --> ORCH
    A2 -. milestone export .-> DATA
    ORCH --> LLM
    LLM --> GEN
    GEN --> CAND
    CAND -.-> VER
    REF -.-> GEN
    LLM --> REF
    ORCH --> VER
    VER --> GGEN
    VER --> EVAL
    ORCH --> EVAL
    ORCH --> DATA
    GEN -. agent writes candidates .-> DATA

    style GEN fill:#f7e7a8,stroke:#b8860b
    style REF fill:#f7e7a8,stroke:#b8860b
    style LLM fill:#f7e7a8,stroke:#b8860b
    style CAND fill:#f7e7a8,stroke:#b8860b
    style VER fill:#cfe8d6,stroke:#2e6e5e
    style GGEN fill:#cfe8d6,stroke:#2e6e5e
    style EVAL fill:#cfe8d6,stroke:#2e6e5e
